# Company tools, appended to the dotfiles Brewfile on macOS. Same syntax as any
# Brewfile; failures are reported but never stop the rest of the apply.
# A cask whose app is already in /Applications is skipped. GUI apps people
# pick per machine belong in catalog.toml (with `apps`) instead.

